# Domain / data / tests

## Types & domain

- Shared models live in `src/domain/types.ts` — extend there, don’t fork shapes in components
- Domain functions are pure: inputs in, values out; no `fetch`, DOM, or storage
- Prefer `interface` for object shapes; string-union aliases for IDs/enums already in types
- Time is pull-relative **seconds** (`timeSec`); format `m:ss` only at export/UI edges

```ts
// ❌ BAD — mutate boss JSON inside auto-assign as a side effect
// ✅ GOOD — return new Assignment[]; UI applies overrides via withTimeOverrides
```

## Boss / spell JSON

- Canonical data: `data/bosses/*.json`, `data/spells/*.json`
- Register new bosses in `src/data/catalog.ts` imports + `BOSSES` array
- Windows need `id`, `timeSec`, `ability`, `trigger`, `severity`, `category`
- Set `assignCd: false` for informational rows; `suggestPersonals: true` (or soak/soft-CD notes) for raid personals
- Document timer source in `source` / `sourceUrl`

## Export

- NSRT + readable text only go through `src/export/` using catalog lookups
- Don’t embed note formatting inside React components

## Vitest

- `npm test` / colocated `*.test.ts`; environment is **node**
- Cover assign conflicts, uncovered windows, and edge timers with small fixture bosses
- Import via `@/domain/...`; no component/DOM tests unless explicitly requested
- Assert behavior, not implementation details

```ts
// ✅ GOOD
expect(uncoveredWindows(boss, assignments)).toEqual([]);
```
